Thanks for the votes! I'll cast a final +1 myself and close the vote out.

This KIP passes with the following +1 votes (and no +0 or -1 votes):

=E2=80=A2 Greg Harris
=E2=80=A2 Yash Mayya
=E2=80=A2 Knowles Atchison Jr
=E2=80=A2 Mickael Maison (binding)
=E2=80=A2 Tom Bentley (binding)
=E2=80=A2 Josep Prat (binding)
=E2=80=A2 Chris Egerton (binding, author)

I'll write up Jira tickets and begin implementing things next week.

Cheers,

Chris

