Hey Luke,

Thank you for the review! My reasoning for going to ZK 3.8.1 directly is tha=
t if there isn=E2=80=99t a set date for the Kafka 4.0 release it gives us mo=
re time before we have to (potentially) upgrade ZK again (similar to what is=
 mentioned here https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/12620#issuecomment-1245=
590870). ZK 3.7.1 also doesn=E2=80=99t support earlier client/server combina=
