Alexandre Dupriez created KAFKA-14780:
-----------------------------------------

             Summary: Make RefreshingHttpsJwksTest#testSecondaryRefreshAfte=
rElapsedDelay deterministic
                 Key: KAFKA-14780
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14780
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Test
            Reporter: Alexandre Dupriez


The test `RefreshingHttpsJwksTest#testSecondaryRefreshAfterElapsedDelay` re=
lies on the actual system clock which makes it frequently fail on my poor i=
ntellij setup.

=C2=A0

The `RefreshingHttpsJwks` component creates and uses a scheduled executor s=
ervice. We could expose the scheduling mechanism to be able to mock its beh=
aviour. One way to do could be to use the `KafkaScheduler` which has a `Moc=
kScheduler` implementation which relies on `MockTime` instead of the real t=
ime clock.



--
