Currently, StandardAuthorizer uses R/W locks to keep the data consistent be=
tween reads. The intent of this Jira is to remove the R/W locks by using th=
e persistent data structures library like - [pcollections|https://github.co=
m/hrldcpr/pcollections], [Paguro|https://github.com/GlenKPeterson/Paguro] a=
nd [Vavr|[https://github.com/vavr-io/vavr].]=C2=A0



