Hi,

I'm late to this conversation, but it's a bit odd to backport the flexible
versions change to "3.0.3, 3.1.3, 3.2.4, 3.3.3, and 3.4.1" unless we intend
to release an update for each of these. So, I suggest that either we commit
to releasing an update for each of these versions or we reduce the set of
versions we backport the change to.

Ismael

